WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Get Your Black. 得其黑.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.500
The box. The only place the name appears.

00:09.500 --> 00:14.800
The lid has weight. The minute is quiet on purpose.

00:14.800 --> 00:20.000
The cap, seated. Unmarked.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.200
Black cloth. A plain buckle. Nothing to advertise.

00:25.200 --> 00:29.800
Worn out. The house stays at home.

00:29.800 --> 00:35.200
The name stays in the box.
